The Mercedes-Benz A140 was part of the first two generations of the A-Class (W168, 1997-2004 and W169, 2004-2012) and is not a current model in the latest W177 generation (2018-present). Therefore, I will evaluate the last produced A140 model (from the W168 or W169 era) against today's market benchmarks. Based on the search results, the W168 A140 (1998-2004) had an 82 hp 1.4L engine. The W169 A140 (2005-2012) had a 95 hp 1.5L engine, but the search results primarily detail the W168 A140. I will use the W168 A140 specs as representative of the "most recent" A140 widely detailed.

